:'''(Trailblazer):''' (It's... Robin?)
:'''Black Swan:''' Alright, please come with me.
:'''(Trailblazer):''' These people are...?
:'''Acheron:''' They're the ones who accept Ena's Dream and indulge in their happy illusions...
